#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid ""
"A depreciation entry will be posted on and including the date %(date)s. <br/"
"> %(extra_text)s Future entries will be recomputed to depreciate the asset "
"following the changes."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຈະຖືກລົງບັນຊີໃນ ແລະ ລວມທັງວັນທີ %(date)s. <br/> %(extra_text)s ລາຍການໃນ"
"ອະນາຄົດຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຂອງຊັບສິນຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid ""
"A depreciation entry will be posted on and including the date %(date)s.<br/> "
"A disposal entry will be posted on the %(account_type)s account <b>%"
"(account)s</b>."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຈະຖືກລົງບັນຊີໃນ ແລະ ລວມທັງວັນທີ %(date)s.<br/> ລາຍການການກຳຈັດຈະຖືກລົງບັນຊີໃ"
"ນ %(account_type)s ບັນຊີ <b>%(account)s</b>."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid ""
"A depreciation entry will be posted on and including the date %(date)s.<br/> "
"A second entry will neutralize the original income and post the  outcome of "
"this sale on account <b>%(account)s</b>."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຈະຖືກລົງບັນຊີໃນ ແລະ ລວມທັງວັນທີ %(date)s.<br/> ລາຍການທີສອງຈະໄປຫັກລ້າງລາຍຮັບ"
"ເດີມ ແລະ ລົງບັນຊີຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງການຂາຍນີ້ໃນບັນຊີ <b>%(account)s</b>."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid "A depreciation entry will be posted on and including the date %s."
msgstr "ລາຍການຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຈະຖືກລົງບັນຊີໃນ ແລະ ລວມທັງວັນທີ %s."

#. module: account_depreciation
