#. module: account_depreciation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_depreciation.field_resource_asset__depreciation_method
msgid ""
"Choose the method to use to compute the amount of depreciation lines.\n"
"  * Straight Line: Calculated on basis of: Gross Value / Duration\n"
"  * Declining: Calculated on basis of: Residual Value * Declining Factor\n"
"  * Declining then Straight Line: Like Declining but with a minimum "
"depreciation value equal to the straight line value."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກວິທີການຄິດໄລ່ຈຳນວນຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ.\n"
"  * ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (Straight Line): ຄິດໄລ່ຈາກ: ມູນຄ່າລວມ / ໄລຍະເວລາ\n"
"  * ແບບຫຼຸດລົງ (Declining): ຄິດໄລ່ຈາກ: ມູນຄ່າຄົງເຫຼືອ * ຕົວຄູນຫຼຸດລົງ\n"
"  * ແບບຫຼຸດລົງແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຊື່: ຄືກັບແບບຫຼຸດລົງ ແຕ່ມີມູນຄ່າຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຂັ້ນຕ່ຳເທົ່າກັບແບບເສັ້ນຊື່."

