#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/controller/asset_template_controller.py:0
msgid ""
"The balance sheet account for the asset itself (e.g., \"151000 Fixed "
"Asset\"). Must exist in Odoo and be of \"Fixed Asset\" or \"Non-current "
"Assets\" type."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີໃບລາຍງານຖານະການເງິນສຳລັບຕົວຊັບສິນເອງ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"151000 ຊັບສິນຄົງທີ່\"). ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນ Odoo ແລ"
"ະ ເປັນປະເພດ \"ຊັບສິນຄົງທີ່\" ຫຼື \"ຊັບສິນບໍ່ໝູນວຽນ\"."

#. module: account_depreciation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_depreciation.field_resource_asset__child_ids
msgid "The children are the gains in value of this asset"
msgstr "ລາຍການລູກແມ່ນການເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຂອງມູນຄ່າຂອງຊັບສິນນີ້"

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/controller/asset_template_controller.py:0
msgid ""
"The code or name of the associated journal in Odoo for depreciation entries "
"(e.g., MISC - Miscellaneous Operations, INV - Customer Invoices, BILL - "
"Vendor Bills)."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດ ຫຼື ຊື່ຂອງສະໝຸດບັນຊີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນ Odoo ສຳລັບລາຍການຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ (ເຊັ່ນ: MISC - ການດຳເນີນງານທົ່ວ"
"ໄປ, INV - ໃບເກັບເງິນລູກຄ້າ, BILL - ໃບບິນຜູ້ຈຳໜ່າຍ)."

#. module: account_depreciation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_depreciation.field_asset_modify__invoice_ids
msgid ""
"The disposal invoice is needed in order to generate the closing journal "
"entry."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໃບເກັບເງິນກຳຈັດຊັບສິນເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍການບັນຊີປິດຮອບວຽນ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/controller/asset_template_controller.py:0
msgid ""
"The estimated residual value of the asset at the end of its useful life. "
"This amount will not be depreciated. Considered in company currency."
msgstr ""
"ມູນຄ່າຄົງເຫຼືອທີ່ຄາດຄະເນຂອງຊັບສິນເມື່ອໝົດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ. ຈຳນວນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ. ຄິດໄລ່ເປັນສະກຸນ"
"ເງິນຂອງບໍລິສັດ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/controller/asset_template_controller.py:0
msgid ""
"The expense account for posting periodic depreciation entries (e.g., "
"\"630000 Depreciation Expenses\"). Must exist in Odoo and be of "
"\"Depreciation\" or \"Expense\" type."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີລາຍຈ່າຍສຳລັບລົງບັນຊີຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຕາມຮອບວຽນ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"630000 ລາຍຈ່າຍຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ\"). ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນ "
"Odoo ແລະ ເປັນປະເພດ \"ຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນ\" ຫຼື \"ລາຍຈ່າຍ\"."

#. module: account_depreciation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_depreciation.field_resource_asset__depreciation_duration
msgid "The number of depreciations needed to depreciate your asset"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນຊັບສິນຂອງທ່ານຈົນໝົດ"

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
