msgstr "ມູນຄ່າຄົງເຫຼືອໃນແຖວຄ່າຫຼຸ້ຍຫ້ຽນສຸດທ້າຍຕ້ອງເປັນ 0"

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/controller/asset_template_controller.py:0
msgid ""
"The total amount of depreciation already recorded for the asset before "
