msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນຄຸນສົມບັດໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຊັບສິນທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງແບບຈຳລອງຊັບສິນໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"You can't post an entry related to a draft asset. Please post the asset "
"before."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລົງບັນຊີລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊັບສິນທີ່ຍັງເປັນຮ່າງ. ກະລຸນາຢືນຢັນຊັບສິນກ່ອນ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid "You can't re-evaluate the asset before the lock date."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປະເມີນມູນຄ່າຊັບສິນໃໝ່ກ່ອນວັນທີປິດງວດບັນຊີ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot add or remove bills when the asset is already running or closed."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບໃບບິນໄດ້ເມື່ອຊັບສິນກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ປິດແລ້ວ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid "You cannot archive a record that is not closed"
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດເກັບລາຍການທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ປິດ"

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/models/account_asset.py:0
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot automate the journal entry for an asset that has a running gross "
"increase. Please use 'Dispose' on the increase(s)."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລົງບັນຊີອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຊັບສິນທີ່ມີການເພີ່ມມູນຄ່າລວມທີ່ຍັງດຳເນີນຢູ່. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ 'ກຳຈັດ' "
"ໃນລາຍການເພີ່ມມູນຄ່ານັ້ນກ່ອນ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot create an asset from lines containing credit and debit on the "
"account or with a null amount"
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຊັບສິນຈາກແຖວທີ່ມີທັງເບື້ອງໜີ້ ແລະ ເບື້ອງມີ ຫຼື ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນເງິນເປັນສູນ"

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid "You cannot delete a document that is in %s state."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບເອກະສານທີ່ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະ %s."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot delete an asset linked to posted entries.\n"
"You should either confirm the asset, then, sell or dispose of it, or cancel "
"the linked journal entries."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຊັບສິນທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບລາຍການທີ່ລົງບັນຊີແລ້ວ.\n"
"ທ່ານຄວນຢືນຢັນຊັບສິນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຂາຍ ຫຼື ກຳຈັດ, ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກລາຍການບັນຊີທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງນັ້ນກ່ອນ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_depreciation/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid "You cannot dispose of an asset before the lock date."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດກຳຈັດຊັບສິນກ່ອນວັນທີປິດງວດບັນຊີ."

#. module: account_depreciation
#. odoo-python
